  "notes": "GAAP. Governmental lines from Total Governmental Funds column (p5). Business-type from Statement of Revenues, Expenses and Changes in Net Position - Proprietary Fund (p7); no single printed total, so receipts/disbursements totals computed (operating plus nonoperating items; disbursements equal total business-type expenses 1,556,931 on p3). Business-type capital contributions 21,248 recorded as other_financing. Governmental fund transfers in/out 96,988 are from the total column (net zero). Government-wide statement of net position total column used for balance_sheet (p2). Special assessments in total column current 86,715 and noncurrent 309,584; land 390,197 + 326,655 = 716,852 shown as printed in total column of land and construction in progress. Proprietary cash flow has no noncapital financing section. Budget schedule (p10) is budgetary basis, different from GAAP statement; recorded as detail. Nonmajor combining schedule p11 is all zeros except beginning/ending balance 15,308; no lines. Read pages 1-11 of 11. Intergovernmental 835,785 split by fund column (p5): General Fund 600,578 intergovernmental/state aid, ARP fund 235,207 federal grants."
